1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,515
Cytokinins promote cell division, cytokinesis, which gives them their name, though only when auxin is also present.

2
00:00:08,515 --> 00:00:14,427
The first, kinetin, was found by Miller and Skoog in autoclaved herring sperm DNA.

3
00:00:14,427 --> 00:00:18,632
The first natural one, zeatin, came from maize grains.

4
00:00:18,632 --> 00:00:23,880
Cytokinins are made mainly in root tips and travel up in the xylem.

